title: Microsoft Hyper-V Cluster: Cluster shared volume usage
agents: windows
catalog: os/storage
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the used space of the cluster shared volumes (CSV) of a
 Microsoft Windows failover cluster running Hyper-V.

 Levels and trends are configured with the rule "Filesystems (used space and growth)".

 The data is collected by the agent plug-in {hyperv_cluster.ps1}, which can be
 deployed with the agent bakery rule "Hyper-V".

item:
 The name of the cluster shared volume.

discovery:
 One service is created for each cluster shared volume.
